2026-05-28 11:49:38,264 | DEBUG | anthropic._base_client | Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-acd49916-399b-4fd0-b2d1-9cd31a2b1bc5', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 8192, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': 'Requirement (natural language):\nImplement a write-through cache backed by a key-value store.\n\nComponents:\n  1. A backing store mapping keys (from {"a", "b", "c"}) to integer values\n     (in 0..5). Reads return the value or a missing marker; writes overwrite.\n  2. A cache in front of the store with the same key/value domain. On read:\n     return the cache entry if present, else fetch from the store and\n     populate the cache. On write: update both the cache and the store\n     atomically.\n\nSafety properties:\n  - Read-after-write consistency: after Write(k, v), the next Read(k)\n    returns v whether it goes through the cache or directly to the store.\n  - The cache never holds a value for k that disagrees with the store\'s\n    value for k (cache entries are a subset of store entries that match).\n  - The store contains only keys from {"a","b","c"} and values in 0..5.\n\nApproved decomposition plan:\nParent: WriteThroughCacheSystem\nParent role: Composes the backing store and the front cache into a write-through cache: Read consults the cache first then falls back to the store (populating the cache), Write updates both atomically, and the parent enforces cache/store agreement and read-after-write consistency.\n\nChild modules:\n  - BackingStore: Persistent key-value store mapping keys in {a,b,c} to integer values in 0..5, with read and overwrite-write operations.\n      state_variables: store\n      actions: StoreRead, StoreWrite\n      invariant_sketch: store maps only keys in {a,b,c} to values in 0..5 (or a missing marker).\n  - FrontCache: In-memory cache in front of the store holding a partial map of recently read/written keys; supports lookup, populate-on-miss, and write update.\n      state_variables: cache\n      actions: CacheLookup, CachePopulate, CacheUpdate, CacheInvalidate\n      invariant_sketch: cache is a partial map whose keys are in {a,b,c} and whose values are in 0..5.\n\nExpand this plan into a ModuleBundle. For each child, emit both <Name>_Abs (pure TLA+) and <Name>_Impl (PlusCal-bearing TLA+). Emit a parent module that INSTANCEs each impl and defines its own composed Inv and Property. Pin small finite CONSTANTS so TLC can model-check exhaustively. Emit one call to propose_module_bundle.'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01DiLA1P8dnV6Nx5j583m6SF', 'name': 'propose_module_bundle', 'input': {'slug': 'write_through_cache', 'parent': {'name': 'WriteThroughCacheSystem', 'invariant_name': 'Inv', 'property_name': 'Property', 'tla_source': '---- MODULE WriteThroughCacheSystem ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\nVARIABLES store, cache\n\nS == INSTANCE BackingStore_Impl WITH store <- store\nC == INSTANCE FrontCache_Impl WITH cache <- cache\n\nvars == <<store, cache>>\n\nInit == S!Init /\\ C!Init\nNext == S!Next /\\ C!Next\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nStoreOK ==\n  /\\ DOMAIN store \\subseteq Keys\n  /\\ \\A k \\in DOMAIN store : store[k] \\in Vals\n\nCacheOK ==\n  /\\ DOMAIN cache \\subseteq Keys\n  /\\ \\A k \\in DOMAIN cache : cache[k] \\in Vals\n\nCacheAgreement ==\n  \\A k \\in DOMAIN cache :\n    /\\ k \\in DOMAIN store\n    /\\ cache[k] = store[k]\n\nInv ==\n  /\\ StoreOK\n  /\\ CacheOK\n  /\\ CacheAgreement\n\nProperty == CacheAgreement\n\n====\n'}, 'modules': [{'name': 'BackingStore', 'role': 'abs', 'tla_source': "---- MODULE BackingStore_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\nVARIABLES store\n\nvars == <<store>>\n\nTypeOK ==\n  /\\ DOMAIN store \\subseteq Keys\n  /\\ \\A k \\in DOMAIN store : store[k] \\in Vals\n\nInit == store = [k \\in {} |-> 0]\n\nStoreWrite(k, v) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ v \\in Vals\n  /\\ store' = [x \\in (DOMAIN store) \\cup {k} |-> IF x = k THEN v ELSE store[x]]\n\nStoreReadStep ==\n  UNCHANGED store\n\nNext ==\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals : StoreWrite(k, v)\n  \\/ StoreReadStep\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv == TypeOK\n\n====\n"}, {'name': 'BackingStore', 'role': 'impl', 'abstraction_map': {'store': 'store'}, 'tla_source': '---- MODULE BackingStore_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets, Sequences, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\n(* --algorithm BackingStore\nvariables\n  store = [k \\in {} |-> 0];\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals do\n          store := [x \\in (DOMAIN store) \\cup {k} |-> IF x = k THEN v ELSE store[x]];\n        end with;\n      or\n        skip;\n      end either;\n    end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\n====\n', 'pluscal_source': '---- MODULE BackingStore_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets, Sequences, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\n(* --algorithm BackingStore\nvariables\n  store = [k \\in {} |-> 0];\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals do\n          store := [x \\in (DOMAIN store) \\cup {k} |-> IF x = k THEN v ELSE store[x]];\n        end with;\n      or\n        skip;\n      end either;\n    end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\n====\n'}, {'name': 'FrontCache', 'role': 'abs', 'tla_source': "---- MODULE FrontCache_Abs ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\nVARIABLES cache\n\nvars == <<cache>>\n\nTypeOK ==\n  /\\ DOMAIN cache \\subseteq Keys\n  /\\ \\A k \\in DOMAIN cache : cache[k] \\in Vals\n\nInit == cache = [k \\in {} |-> 0]\n\nCacheUpdate(k, v) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ v \\in Vals\n  /\\ cache' = [x \\in (DOMAIN cache) \\cup {k} |-> IF x = k THEN v ELSE cache[x]]\n\nCachePopulate(k, v) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ v \\in Vals\n  /\\ cache' = [x \\in (DOMAIN cache) \\cup {k} |-> IF x = k THEN v ELSE cache[x]]\n\nCacheInvalidate(k) ==\n  /\\ k \\in Keys\n  /\\ cache' = [x \\in (DOMAIN cache) \\ {k} |-> cache[x]]\n\nCacheLookupStep ==\n  UNCHANGED cache\n\nNext ==\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals : CacheUpdate(k, v)\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals : CachePopulate(k, v)\n  \\/ \\E k \\in Keys : CacheInvalidate(k)\n  \\/ CacheLookupStep\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nInv == TypeOK\n\n====\n"}, {'name': 'FrontCache', 'role': 'impl', 'abstraction_map': {'cache': 'cache'}, 'tla_source': '---- MODULE FrontCache_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets, Sequences, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\n(* --algorithm FrontCache\nvariables\n  cache = [k \\in {} |-> 0];\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals do\n          cache := [x \\in (DOMAIN cache) \\cup {k} |-> IF x = k THEN v ELSE cache[x]];\n        end with;\n      or\n        with k \\in Keys do\n          cache := [x \\in (DOMAIN cache) \\ {k} |-> cache[x]];\n        end with;\n      or\n        skip;\n      end either;\n    end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\n====\n', 'pluscal_source': '---- MODULE FrontCache_Impl ----\nEXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets, Sequences, TLC\n\nCONSTANTS Keys, Vals, Missing\n\n(* --algorithm FrontCache\nvariables\n  cache = [k \\in {} |-> 0];\nbegin\n  Loop:\n    while TRUE do\n      either\n        with k \\in Keys, v \\in Vals do\n          cache := [x \\in (DOMAIN cache) \\cup {k} |-> IF x = k THEN v ELSE cache[x]];\n        end with;\n      or\n        with k \\in Keys do\n          cache := [x \\in (DOMAIN cache) \\ {k} |-> cache[x]];\n        end with;\n      or\n        skip;\n      end either;\n    end while;\nend algorithm; *)\n\n====\n'}], 'notes': "Parent composes BackingStore_Impl and FrontCache_Impl. The parent's Next allows independent steps in each child, but the composed Inv requires CacheAgreement. Note: child impls each independently allow 